      "nets": ["NET0035", "+3V3", "+5V"],
      "observed": "NET0035 connects J7 pin 9 to J11 pin 3. The schematic also places a +3V3 power symbol on NET0035 at the M-BUS connector and a +5V power symbol on the J11 pin 3 connection, tying the +3V3 and +5V rails together.",
      "expected": "The +3V3 and +5V rails should remain separate. The specification describes the PortB breakout as carrying +5V and two GPIOs, passed through from the M5Stack bus; it should not connect a bus pin on +3V3 to +5V.",
